"qytberMI","hashes":{"sha1":"fa03640ba1e4ef2f7ae3619c6373a06e46d0ba2c","sha512":"d8d3312f77fc52a48e4a6cd836fda33669bdebcb4de0b8c0d30adc808b287330a533e0baef355cc1ce6336a26851d9775369a802a4666b7b7a6266af20088f42"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/YL57xq9U/versions/vTN4NRGW/iris-fabric-1.11.7%2Bmc26.3.jar","filename":"iris-fabric-1.11.7+mc26.3.jar","primary":true,"size":2850938,"file_type":null}],"dependencies":[{"version_id":"bAZQdGpg","project_id":"AANobbMI","file_name":null,"dependency_type":"required"}]},"2ca92fb530135d2baddf0ba4cc4f93976234876a38c4aa02b487b2552400f005afcfbeebf5373fb4396fe2020537a42d7597b8da5a52b904355ef51d5fef07ad":{"game_versions":["26.3"],"loaders":["fabric","quilt"],"environment":"client_or_server_prefers_both","id":"fWv5bnZk","project_id":"gvQqBUqZ","author_id":"uhPSqlnd","featured":false,"name":"Lithium 0.26.3 for Fabric","version_number":"mc26.3-0.26.3-fabric","changelog":"Lithium 0.26.3 for Minecraft 26.3.x fixes several issues.\n\nMake sure to take a backup of your world before using the mod and please report any bugs and mod compatibility issues at the [issue tracker](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium-fabric/issues). You can check the [description of each optimization](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium/blob/mc26.3-0.26.3/lithium-mixin-config.md) and how to disable it when encountering a problem.\n\n## Fixes\n- Avoid caching chest inventories when the corresponding block state is a chest half\n- Fix removed player memory leak in MapItemSavedData when maps are in item frames. Also avoid sending unnecessary map data packets\n- Fix entity step up movement collision not including hard entities","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-10-28T22:31:14.497352Z","downloads":1052357,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":null,"files":[{"id":"BXnzd18M","hashes":{"sha512":"2ca92fb530135d2baddf0ba4cc4f93976234876a38c4aa02b487b2552400f005afcfbeebf5373fb4396fe2020537a42d7597b8da5a52b904355ef51d5fef07ad","sha1":"2d3afe9d43bb2549e23479d8d93e644ff366bebf"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gvQqBUqZ/versions/fWv5bnZk/lithium-fabric-0.26.3%2Bmc26.3.jar","filename":"lithium-fabric-0.26.3+mc26.3.jar","primary":true,"size":919892,"file_type":null}],"dependencies":[]},"42fe06a46a9e893b8a12324255368517132b262c8fce5d7eab1d60a5ec7f9f6d57aadf90d1a2ede7d9bbab606bdcf98e8676cc90ec818b601bbfcd9b96296cb3":{"game_versions":["26.3"],"loaders":["fabric","quilt"],"environment":"client_or_server_prefers_both","id":"71CTWqdE","project_id":"nvQzSEkH","author_id":"UxbEV316","featured":false,"name":"[Fabric 26.3.X] 26.3.5","version_number":"26.3.5+fabric","changelog":"## 26.3.5\r\n\r\n- Merge branch '26.3-fabric' of https://github.com/Snownee/Jade into 26.3-fabric\r\n- fix: publish config value before onUpdate to prevent re-entrant StackOverflowError ([#821](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/821))\r\n- refactor: route DataComponentMap.Builder component check through CommonProxy\r\n\r\n## 26.3.4\r\n\r\n- improve: ConfigIcon.Item now holds ItemStackTemplate\r\n- chore: fix typo and bump mixin compatibility level to Java 25\r\n- fix: validate entity targets on the server\r\n- fix: only request server data providers acknowledged by the server\r\n- fix: write config files atomically and fix CachedSupplier publication\r\n- fix: always clean up fetching state in PlayerNameLookup\r\n- fix: rate limit server data requests to prevent packet spam\r\n- improve: do not ignore invisible entity if it has equipment (close [#83](https://github.com/Snownee/JadeAddons/issues/83))\r\n\r\n## 26.3.3\r\n\r\n- fix: trial spawner cooldown shown under unexpected situation (close [#815](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/815))\r\n- feat: villager restock cooldown\r\n- refactor: rebuild config search results only when they change\r\n- refactor: play popup toggle sound in SecondaryPopup\r\n\r\n## 26.3.2\r\n\r\n- feat: config UI card mode\r\n- refactor: decouple options UI from config model for reuse\r\n- build: minify JSON resources when packaging the jar\r\n\r\n## 26.3.1\r\n\r\n- fix: check collider shape when ray tracing entities\r\n- feat: add recipe lookup keybind tooltips\r\n- rc1\r\n- fix: improve compatibility with Create Aeronautics\r\n- fix: item serialization incompatibility with polymer (close [#792](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/792))\r\n- fix: Width of TextElementImpl is miscalculated when Caxton is present\r\n- feat: box progress provider API ([#811](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/811))\r\n- fix: check block entity type in vanilla providers (close [#765](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/765))\r\n- feat: drag to scroll list\r\n- fix: entity ray tracing (close [#749](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/749))\r\n- refactor: abstract SmoothScrollableList\r\n- fix: OptionsNav entries not clickable after MC 26.3 mouse button renumbering\r\n- feat: use fabric enchantment power provider api\r\n- pre3\r\n- feat:tool tier removal api\r\n- s10\r\n- feat: add REI placeholders\r\n- fix: [#804](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/804)\r\n- fix: Seagrass harvestability (close [#805](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/805))\r\n- compat: add support for RRV ([#786](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/786))\r\n- Merge branch '26.3-fabric' of https://github.com/Snownee/Jade into 26.3-fabric\r\n- Validate block requests before accessing the level ([#801](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/801))\r\n- s7\r\n- fix: text width calculation (close [#791](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/791))\r\n- improve: use rounded entity health (close [#788](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/788))\r\n- fix: [#796](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/796)\r\n- Merge branch '26.3-fabric' of https://github.com/Snownee/Jade into 26.3-fabric\r\n- feat: add `/jadec generate_server_overrides`\r\n- Update build.gradle for 26.3-fabric\r\n- improve: vanilla harvest addon\r\n- port\r\n- improve: bypass singleplayer reach distance check\r\n\r\n## 26.2.9\r\n\r\n- chore: API javadocs\r\n- Add harvest tool registration API ([#772](https://github.com/Snownee/Jade/issues/772))\r\n","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-10-02T23:48:24.505954Z","downloads":482810,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":null,"files":[{"id":"kxtFx3Ft","hashes":{"sha1":"da61413c586c8918c14e2bbfdc808ce2d56ea9df","sha512":"2e7331e62eb6658268ae92dc42de8b469f50dd6c6a9d2546a6f649bae97c2cdfd8d4c1560948cf46269175d2c79c6c47a36a02685e39d476768d18fbb2a28703"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nvQzSEkH/versions/71CTWqdE/Jade-mc26.3-Fabric-26.3.5.jar","filename":"Jade-mc26.3-Fabric-26.3.5.jar","primary":true,"size":1092685,"file_type":null},{"id":"bDO4LMkn","hashes":{"sha1":"5c1321e9d6f9d1ba0e62666394013fcc44b88dd7","sha512":"288a811312e66d9eb9bf608f0c025a74c57ed4959bfe426efb7828c760e12d4bdd520fae790c2a016c79f06c8b9bac112bb83ad981d42d293d28a7eb75901028"},"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nvQzSEkH/versions/71CTWqdE/Jade-mc26.3-Fabric-26.3.5-sources.jar","filename":"Jade-mc26.3-Fabric-26.3.5-sources.jar","primary":false,"size":547160,"file_type":null}],"dependencies":[{"version_id":null,"project_id":"u6dRKJwZ","file_name":null,"dependency_type":"optional"},{"version_id":null,"project_id":"P7dR8mSH","file_name":null,"dependency_type":"required"}]},"5ff2491ed2dbd8ccad452fbf0492426b5d97c36bd7ad7dfe2d365739ba2ad43e7f67f9fe4978a18ba3c3a22683f0b717d9ef42a17dfb6142b1197654a9a8a1ea":{"game_versions":["26.3"],"loaders":["fabric"],"environment":"client_or_server_prefers_both","id":"Zebwcvua","project_id":"u6dRKJwZ","author_id":"nMXRSbhF","featured":false,"name":"31.14.0.72 for Fabric 26.3","version_number":"31.14.0.72","changelog":"  * [Close #4558 Allow decorators to override recipe source IDs](https://github.com/mezz/JustEnoughItems/commit/b011f2bcc57d0a920d38669c025fcbf1300700d9) - mezz\n","changelog_url":null,"date_published":"2026-10-16T14:51:04.719156Z","downloads":100218,"version_type":"release","status":"listed","requested_status":nu